<title>UK: Tarmac, Hanson 's Arc in venture.</title>
<headline>Tarmac, Hanson 's Arc in venture.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British construction materials and services firm Tarmac Plc and Arc Ltd, the subsidiary of Hanson Plc, said they were merging a number of quarrying and asphalt manufacturing operations to form a joint venture.</p>
<p>The new venture will be called Midland Quarry Products Ltd, the groups said in a joint statement.</p>
</text>
